WEBVTT

00:14:28.454 --> 00:14:32.204
Our emotions contain flashing lights
to things that we care about.

00:14:33.079 --> 00:14:35.287
We tend not to feel strong emotion.

00:14:36.204 --> 00:14:38.996
To stuff that doesn't mean
anything in our world.

00:14:40.662 --> 00:14:45.371
If you feel rage when you read the news
that rage is a signpost, perhaps,

00:14:45.371 --> 00:14:48.329
that you value equity and fairness and

00:14:48.329 --> 00:14:51.996
an opportunity to take active steps to
shape your life in that direction.

00:14:53.496 --> 00:14:55.746
When we are open to the
difficult emotions,

00:14:55.746 --> 00:14:59.079
we are able to generate responses
that are values aligned.